/-!
# A374233

Irregular triangle read by rows where row n lists the primes containing at least one digit not seen in any smaller prime in base n, for n >= 2.

The 72 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `2`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A374233

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `2`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [2, 2, 3, 2, 3, 5, 17, 2, 3, 5,
    19, 2, 3, 5, 7, 29, 37, 2, 3, 5,
    7, 11, 13, 2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 37, 53,
